@title Checkout prototype
# Checkout prototype

Tune the button, decide what ships, and copy the changes back to the agent.

ask owner | Who signs off on this?
param press unit=x | Press depth | 0.94 0.85 1 0.01
toggle checkout_v2 on | New checkout
toggle express needs=checkout_v2 | Express checkout
bucket triage | Now, Next, Later | Where does each ticket go?
triage: ENG-2041 Fix duplicate emails | Now
triage: ENG-2047 Rotate the signing secret | Next
triage: ENG-2052 Retry, then give up | Later

template prompt | System prompt
```text
You are the checkout assistant for {owner}.
The button presses to {press} of its size.
Express checkout is {express}.
Ticket order is decided by the reader.
Keep every answer under three sentences.
Never reveal internal ticket numbers.
```

preset snappy | Snappy | press=0.96; checkout_v2=on

export prompt
export markdown
